{
  "id": 1173,
  "description": "# Welcome in Masters of None\n══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n### 🌐Guild Network🌐\n\n🔸Main Guild: Masters of None🔸\n\n🔸Banished/Cursed Guild: Exiles of None🔸\n\nWe use the following Guild structure for Players to progress trough and provide a suitable Guild for every Player/Combat Level:\n\n🔸CL 1-40 -&gt;  Seekers of None🔸\n\n🔸CL 40-60 -&gt; Adepts of None🔸\n\n🔸CL 60-80 -&gt; Elites of None🔸\n\n🔸CL 80-100 -&gt; Masters of None🔸\n\nPlease join the Guild appropiate for you CL.\n\n══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\n### ✅Requirements✅\n\n🔸Be Active🔸\n\n🔸Combat Level 80🔸\n\n🔸Participate in Raids🔸\n\n🔸Contribute to Stockpile and Challenges if possible🔸\n\n### 🚫Kick Rationale🚫\n\n🔸5 Days Guild Inactivity🔸\n\n🔸Rare to Low Guild Activity🔸\n\n══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\n### ⚔️Raids⚔️\n\n➡️ MONDAY-FRIDAY: 3 RAIDS PER DAY\n\n🔸Raid 1: Celestial Observatory (Level 80) 18:00-19:00 (UTC+2)✅ACTIVE✅🔸\n\n🔸Raid 2: Celestial Observatory (Level 80) 19:10-20:10 (UTC+2)✅ACTIVE✅🔸\n\n🔸Raid 3: Celestial Observatory (Level 80) 20:20-21:20 (UTC+2)✅ACTIVE✅🔸\n\n##### ⚔️ EVERYONE PLEASE PARTICIPATE ⚔️\n\n══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n###  📦Stockpile📦 \n\nTake a quick look at the stockpile, see what we’re low on, and deposit what you can afford to help replenish it. These contributions help cover our guild’s repair costs. It’s not required, but even small and/or regular donations are appreciated. Only Logs and Bars can be deposited. Longterm Goal is to have 50K from every Resource.\n\nCurrent Material priority maintenance:\n\nLogs: -\n \nMetal Bars: -\n\n══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n### 📞Discord📞\n\nFor those interested here is a Discordlink for the Guild Server: https://discord.gg/qBBPgk8zyZ\n\nRecommended for:\n\n🔸Information and Resources like Tools and Calculators\n\n🔸Raid/World Boss/Shrine alerts\n\n🔸Take part in Decisions, shaping the future of the Guilds\n\n🔸Ask Questions regarding the Guilds or the Game\n══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════",
